      "skill_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Necromancer",
          "description": "<p>When another creature you can see loses Hit Points while in Crisis, if they are not undead, you gain 1 Grave Point. You may never have more than 【SL + 1】 Grave Points.<br><br>When you are reduced to 0 Hit Points, you lose all Grave Points; then, if you lost at least 1 Grave Point this way and this is the first time you are reduced to 0 HP during this scene, you do not Surrender nor Sacrifice yourself: instead, you recover an amount of HP equal to 【SL, multiplied by the amount of Grave Points you lost this way】.</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "BEYOND THE REALMS OF DEATH"
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Necromancer",
          "description": "<p>When you cast an offensive spell (r) with a target of \"One creature\", you may spend 2 Grave Points to have it target all creatures you can see that are present on the scene <br><br>(perform a single Magic Check and confront it with the Magic Defense of each target). <br><br>If you do, all damage dealt by the spell becomes dark and its type cannot change</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "RONDO OF NIGHTMARE"
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Entropist",
          "description": "<p>Each time you acquire this Skill, learn one Entropist spell (see next two pages).<br>Offensive (r) Entropist spells use 【INS + WLP】 for the Magic Check.</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "ENTROPIC MAGIC"
        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Orator",
          "description": "<p>During a conflict, you may use an action and spend 5 Mind Points to choose another creature that can hear and understand you. That creature recovers 【SL × 5】 Hit Points and chooses Dexterity, Insight, Might, or Willpower: they treat the chosen Attribute as being one die size higher (up to a maximum of d12) until the start of your next turn.</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "ENCOURAGE"
        },
        "4": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Orator",
          "description": "<p>You may use an action and spend 1 Fabula Point to choose a non-hostile creature able to hear and understand you. If you do, that creature becomes helpful towards you so long as you are kind and respectful to them and your requests are reasonable.</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "UNEXPECTED ALLY"
        },
        "5": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Orator",
          "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">When you successfully perform a Check to fill or erase sections of a Clock, if your approach relied on </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">\"</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">charm</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">diplomacy</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">deception </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">or </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">intimidation\"</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">you may spend up to</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">SL × 20</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Mind Points.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\"> If you do, fill or erase an additional section of that Clock for every 20 Mind Points you spend this way.</span> </p>",
          "level": "2",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "PERSUASIVE"
        },
        "6": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Entropist",
          "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">During a conflict, you use an action by spending</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">5</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Mind Points and choose one effect.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">one creature you can see suffers <span class=\"fontstyle2\">slow</span> <br></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">one creature you can see recovers from <span class=\"fontstyle2\">slow</span> <br></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">one creature you can see may immediately perform the <span class=\"fontstyle2\">Equipment </span>action for free <br></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">one ally you can see who has yet to take a turn during this<br>round: that ally may take their turn immediately after yours during this round <br></span></li>\n</ul>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "STOLEN TIME"
        }
      },
